---
title: 脏页写回流程
type: flowchart
tags: [文件系统, 页缓存, writeback, 脏页]
description: 页面写脏后经过节流与内核线程 wb_workfn 将 inode 脏页写回并提交 bio
---
flowchart TD
    Write[write 系统调用写入数据] --> Dirty[页缓存页被标记为脏页]
    Dirty --> Throttle[balance_dirty_pages 脏页节流]
    Throttle --> |超过阈值| WbThread[bdi 内核线程 wb_workfn]
    WbThread --> WbInodes[writeback_sb_inodes 遍历超级块脏 inode]
    WbInodes --> SingleInode[__writeback_single_inode 写回单个 inode]
    SingleInode --> DoWritepages[调用 address_space 的 writepages]
    DoWritepages --> Ext4Writepages[ext4_writepages 生成写请求]
    Ext4Writepages --> SubmitBio[提交 bio 到块设备]
    SubmitBio --> Complete[bio 完成回调清除脏标志]
    Complete --> Clean[页变为干净页]
